struct fields:
  closed handle 1
  closed handle 2
array and tuple elements:
  closed handle 5
  closed handle 3
  closed handle 4
enum payload and newtype inner value:
  closed handle 7
  closed handle 6
a payload taken out of its variant:
  closed handle 8
one element given up first:
  closed handle 9
  closed handle 10
a field displaced by an assignment:
  closed handle 11
  closed handle 13
  closed handle 12
a holder rotated through a loop:
  closed handle 14
  closed handle 15
  closed handle 16
a heap buffer held in a field:
channels = 2, tracked = 3
